  "religion": {
    "_note": "CHAOTIC only. TOTEMIC shamanism: the orc race-totem is the RED MAW / the Tusked War-Boar; tribes also take totems. The kashap serves the totem and the Chaos-Spirits (the Gul-spirits) by blood-offering on the skull-heap; above all Gul-Maraqus the great War-Spirit (orcs are made for slaughter). The One and the Lawful are demonized and feared. Deity-morphs take the Gul- prefix and no gendered ending (degraded); totems are descriptive bestial Kazhur, not canon-morphs.",
