      "Gul-Maraqus": "a notched cleaver over a skull-heap",
      "Red Maw": "a red, tusked, gaping jaw"
    },
    "race_totem": "the Red Maw (Dhamr-Megargh, the red devouring jaws) / the Tusked War-Boar (Khargan-Behgur)",
    "shaman_rites": "blood-offering on the skull-heap, the totem-pole and the boar-skull standard, the donning of the totem's hide; the Rakh-Khashagh keeps the horde's great-totem.",
    "tribal_totem_pattern": "[Rakh-/Dhamr-/Khashak-/color] + [beast or body-part]: Rakh-Shengur (the Great Fang), Dhamr-Tsibgar (the Blood-Claw), Khashak-Behgur (the Dark-Beast).",
    "venerated": {
      "Maraxus (war-fire, slaughter)": "Gul-Maraqus (the great War-Spirit; served above all)",
